<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans CN, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 960, height: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, right: 0, width: 320, height: 12, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 30, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 2 }}>01 问题与总体框架 · 滚动闭环</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>滚动闭环把「求解一次」变成「持续服务」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>每周期独立重算选择与分配；状态只经执行反馈演化，任务池按四条去路守恒</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 152, left: 60 }}>
    <svg width={1160} height={330} viewBox='0 0 1160 330'>
      <defs>
    <marker id='ah' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='8' refY='3' orient='auto' markerUnits='strokeWidth'>
      <path d='M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z' fill='#1E4FA8' />
    </marker>
    <marker id='ahg' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='8' refY='3' orient='auto' markerUnits='strokeWidth'>
      <path d='M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z' fill='#8B97A8' />
    </marker>
  </defs>
      <text x='18' y='24' font-size='14' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>周期 t 的时序：五步闭环，每周期独立重算选择与分配</text>
      <rect x='18' y='42' width='200' height='84' rx='10' fill='#F0F5FC' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.2' />
      <text x='118' y='72' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>到达入池</text>
      <text x='118' y='96' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>新到 ∪ 滞留 ∪ 释放</text>
      <rect x='248' y='42' width='200' height='84' rx='10' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='1.2' />
      <text x='348' y='72' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>① 任务选择</text>
      <text x='348' y='96' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>预筛 + 边际纳入 + 两闸门</text>
      <rect x='478' y='42' width='200' height='84' rx='10' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='1.2' />
      <text x='578' y='72' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>② MUAS 求解</text>
      <text x='578' y='96' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>编码 → 修复 → 评价 → polish</text>
      <rect x='708' y='42' width='200' height='84' rx='10' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='1.2' />
      <text x='808' y='72' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C' text-anchor='middle'>③ 执行出动</text>
      <text x='808' y='96' font-size='12.5' fill='#4A5568' text-anchor='middle'>按航次序列推进状态</text>
      <rect x='938' y='42' width='200' height='84' rx='10' fill='#0E3F8C' />
      <text x='1038' y='72' font-size='16' font-weight='bold' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle'>④ 反馈更新</text>
      <text x='1038' y='96' font-size='12.5' fill='#C9DCF7' text-anchor='middle'>完成出池 · 未选留池</text>
      <line x1='218' y1='84' x2='246' y2='84' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.8' markerEnd='url(#ah)' />
      <line x1='448' y1='84' x2='476' y2='84' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.8' markerEnd='url(#ah)' />
      <line x1='678' y1='84' x2='706' y2='84' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.8' markerEnd='url(#ah)' />
      <line x1='908' y1='84' x2='936' y2='84' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='1.8' markerEnd='url(#ah)' />
      <path d='M1038,126 L1038,164 L118,164 L118,128' fill='none' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='7,5' markerEnd='url(#ah)' />
      <text x='578' y='156' font-size='13' font-weight='bold' fill='#3D7BD9' text-anchor='middle'>t → t+1：状态只经执行反馈演化，不复制上一周期的解</text>
      <rect x='18' y='184' width='556' height='132' rx='10' fill='#F7F9FC' stroke='#D6DCE5' strokeWidth='1' />
      <text x='34' y='210' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>任务池演化与水位守恒</text>
      <text x='34' y='236' font-size='14' fill='#1A2230'>T(t+1) = remain ∪ new ∪ release</text>
      <text x='34' y='260' font-size='13.5' fill='#4A5568'>arrived = done + unreach + elim + remain</text>
      <text x='34' y='284' font-size='13' fill='#4A5568'>物理不可行才回池；迟到照常完成，不等于废飞。</text>
      <text x='34' y='304' font-size='12' fill='#8B97A8'>防饥饿：等待超阈值或逼近 latest 强制纳入候选集。</text>
      <rect x='590' y='184' width='548' height='132' rx='10' fill='#E8EFF8' />
      <text x='606' y='210' font-size='15' font-weight='bold' fill='#0E3F8C'>机队状态回贯（每周期重算）</text>
      <text x='606' y='236' font-size='13.5' fill='#1A2230'>状态 = 停靠机巢 + 剩余航程 + 可用性</text>
      <text x='606' y='260' font-size='13.5' fill='#4A5568'>B(t) 与 cap(t) 每周期重算；充电中的机是幻影容量，不计入 B(t)。</text>
      <text x='606' y='284' font-size='13' fill='#4A5568'>收敛停机：pool_empty / no_progress / DORMANT 与 static_unreachable 分账。</text>
      <text x='606' y='304' font-size='12' fill='#8B97A8'>代码：methods/rolling/horizon.py（service_patience = 4）</text>
    </svg>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 498, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 156, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 156, background: '#F7F9FC', padding: 16, gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>完成闸门：唯一合法未完成原因</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>迟到交付仍计完成、计全额奖励，不淘汰任务；只有物理不可行（航程 / 时间窗 / 终点不可达）才回池。覆盖门禁把「能装却没装」判非法。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>效果：长程运行不丢任务，滚动闭环把「求解一次」变成「持续服务」。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 156, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 16, gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>滞留与防饥饿</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>跨周期滞留任务带等待补偿 W = 1 − exp(−t/τ)；终刀强优先 + 等待软加权 eff = ratio·(1 + γ·age)，避免长期滞留被反复挤出。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>落选任务不淘汰、留池下周期再评，选择层两道闸门只做可行性判断。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 672, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 进展汇报（合并版）　方法事实按 master c837568 代码核对</Text>
